1
00:00:01,618 --> 00:00:04,982
Showdown Between Blue Cop and Wild Guardy!

2
00:00:07,588 --> 00:00:09,644
Are you sure you're ready for this?

3
00:00:09,644 --> 00:00:11,297
Just go ahead and shoot!

4
00:00:15,398 --> 00:00:17,460
Woah!

5
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:18,937
Here comes the next one!

6
00:00:25,263 --> 00:00:26,567
Wow!

7
00:00:27,211 --> 00:00:29,373
Thank you, thank you.

8
00:00:29,373 --> 00:00:30,545
Those are some skills.

9
00:00:30,545 --> 00:00:32,146
Never missed a shot.

10
00:00:32,146 --> 00:00:36,149
Truly a hunter in the wilds who never ever misses his mark!

11
00:00:37,337 --> 00:00:40,582
Fleta Z, as of today, we're a team!

12
00:00:40,582 --> 00:00:42,640
Once again, thank you for joining us!

13
00:00:42,640 --> 00:00:44,344
Thank you for having me, Jun.

14
00:00:45,707 --> 00:00:46,859
Huh?

15
00:00:46,859 --> 00:00:48,905
What's that on Mega Trucker's head?

16
00:00:50,856 --> 00:00:52,317
Aah!

17
00:00:58,457 --> 00:01:00,646
I am terribly sorry about that.

18
00:01:00,646 --> 00:01:03,326
It's fine. Don't worry about it.

19
00:01:06,569 --> 00:01:07,209
Crest?

20
00:01:07,209 --> 00:01:09,299
Just as I thought. You're all here.

21
00:01:10,495 --> 00:01:12,615
What brings you two here?

22
00:01:13,923 --> 00:01:15,686
Hm. I see that one's been sealed.

23
00:01:15,686 --> 00:01:17,787
I kept my promise!

24
00:01:17,787 --> 00:01:19,996
Now it's your turn to do me a favor.

25
00:01:19,996 --> 00:01:20,793
And what's that?

26
00:01:20,793 --> 00:01:25,150
Tell me the deal with you and Wild Guardy! I want to know everything!

27
00:01:25,150 --> 00:01:26,608
I would like to know as well.

28
00:01:31,555 --> 00:01:33,894
Alright. Where should we begin?

29
00:01:33,894 --> 00:01:37,219
How about when you used to be a Star Guardian on planet Machina?

30
00:01:37,219 --> 00:01:38,748
Star Guardian?

31
00:01:38,748 --> 00:01:39,968
What's that?

32
00:01:39,968 --> 00:01:45,588
An elite force selected to guard Deus Machina, the mother computer of planet Machina.

33
00:01:45,588 --> 00:01:52,479
Blue Cop was chosen among the best of the Metal Cardbots to become one.

34
00:01:52,479 --> 00:02:00,668
I vowed to become a great Star Guardian just like Blue Cop.

35
00:02:00,668 --> 00:02:01,623
However,

36
00:02:01,623 --> 00:02:05,602
My dream was never fulfilled when planet Machina was destroyed.

37
00:02:05,602 --> 00:02:09,486
I managed to escape, and was left to wander the vast universe.

38
00:02:10,379 --> 00:02:13,783
After a long time drifting through space, Wild Guardy crashed down on Earth.

39
00:02:13,783 --> 00:02:14,622
Crashed?

40
00:02:14,622 --> 00:02:16,730
Did your escape pod malfunction?

41
00:02:16,730 --> 00:02:18,735
We don't know.

42
00:02:18,735 --> 00:02:22,151
He was in really bad shape when we found him.

43
00:02:28,328 --> 00:02:30,457
Master! This looks bad...

44
00:02:30,457 --> 00:02:33,748
Sebastian. Turn the car around. Let's take him back to the villa.

45
00:02:33,748 --> 00:02:34,719
Uh- yes, Master!

46
00:02:38,597 --> 00:02:41,608
Fortunately, the villa was equipped with everything we needed for repairs,

47
00:02:41,608 --> 00:02:46,381
because my dad is the CEO of a car company, and my mom a doctor of robot engineering.

48
00:03:06,591 --> 00:03:09,879
At first, we couldn't understand each other.

49
00:03:09,879 --> 00:03:12,120
But even then, we shared a connection.

50
00:03:26,960 --> 00:03:28,546
So this... is planet Earth?

51
00:03:28,546 --> 00:03:31,826
Yes. It's where I was born and raised.

52
00:03:35,277 --> 00:03:36,942
So, what's your name?

53
00:03:36,942 --> 00:03:39,650
In your language, it's Wild Guardy.

54
00:03:39,650 --> 00:03:41,229
I'm Crest.

55
00:03:41,229 --> 00:03:41,920
Let's be friends.

56
00:03:45,793 --> 00:03:48,908
So... That means Crest is like your savior, then?

57
00:03:48,908 --> 00:03:52,729
Yes. He is also a very precious friend that I made on this planet.

58
00:03:52,729 --> 00:03:54,403
A friend?

59
00:03:54,403 --> 00:03:58,441
Then we saw on the news that mysterious robots have been showing up in Mowtown.

60
00:03:58,441 --> 00:03:59,864
We knew right away.

61
00:03:59,864 --> 00:04:04,531
That they had to be Metal Cardbots from planet Machina, just like Wild Guardy.

62
00:04:04,531 --> 00:04:07,655
So, Crest... the reason you transferred here was...

63
00:04:07,655 --> 00:04:10,728
To find out just who these robots were.

64
00:04:10,728 --> 00:04:13,792
Although planet Machina is gone, I can still prove

65
00:04:13,792 --> 00:04:17,961
that I can surpass even a Star Guardian if I can defeat Blue Cop!

66
00:04:17,961 --> 00:04:20,755
I think you may have a mental illness.

67
00:04:20,755 --> 00:04:23,425
You're pretty much stalking Blue bro here.

68
00:04:23,425 --> 00:04:27,480
It might be better for you to spread your wings and be free.

69
00:04:27,480 --> 00:04:30,442
You simpletons have no clue about the loneliness and woes

70
00:04:30,442 --> 00:04:32,792
of someone with the dream of becoming the best!

71
00:04:32,792 --> 00:04:33,961
What?!

72
00:04:33,961 --> 00:04:39,757
I will rise above the Star Guardian and become king of the Metal Cardbots!

73
00:04:39,757 --> 00:04:42,502
What is this guy even going on about?!

74
00:04:42,502 --> 00:04:44,709
If that's what you want...

75
00:04:44,709 --> 00:04:46,396
I will give you a chance.

76
00:04:46,396 --> 00:04:47,920
What?!

77
00:04:47,920 --> 00:04:47,759
Huh?

78
00:04:47,759 --> 00:04:51,514
Yup! In return, you have to promise to join our team if you lose.

79
00:04:51,514 --> 00:04:53,310
Sounds interesting.

80
00:04:53,310 --> 00:04:55,341
Take them on, Wild Guardy.

81
00:04:55,341 --> 00:04:56,461
What?!

82
00:04:56,461 --> 00:04:57,855
Crest, not you too...

83
00:04:57,855 --> 00:05:02,795
But... if you lose, you have to hand over the Metal Breath. Do you accept?

84
00:05:02,795 --> 00:05:03,733
I accept!

85
00:05:03,733 --> 00:05:05,627
No! You mustn't, Jun.

86
00:05:05,627 --> 00:05:07,759
Are you afraid, Blue Cop?

87
00:05:07,759 --> 00:05:09,149
No, it's not that-

88
00:05:09,149 --> 00:05:16,237
You guys... you weren't thinking about having your duel in the middle of my car center, were you?!

89
00:05:16,237 --> 00:05:18,773
I think we better find another location.

90
00:05:18,773 --> 00:05:22,408
Actually... I think I know the perfect place. If you'd follow me, please.

91
00:05:39,595 --> 00:05:40,492
Now!

92
00:05:40,492 --> 00:05:41,408
Let us begin!

93
00:05:45,754 --> 00:05:47,600
Metal Breath, pickup!

94
00:05:49,194 --> 00:05:50,521
Mega Trucker, setup!

95
00:05:53,793 --> 00:05:55,340
What's this?

96
00:05:55,340 --> 00:05:56,338
That's not Blue Cop!

97
00:05:56,338 --> 00:05:58,577
I said we'll take you on!

98
00:05:58,577 --> 00:06:00,920
But I never said it would be a one on one match!

99
00:06:00,920 --> 00:06:05,242
If you want the Metal Breath, you'll have to get through all of us first!

100
00:06:05,242 --> 00:06:06,608
What?!

101
00:06:06,608 --> 00:06:11,593
Don't worry about it. I'm sure you can handle them all.

102
00:06:11,593 --> 00:06:13,163
I'll finish them with one strike.

103
00:06:13,163 --> 00:06:15,199
Alright then! Let's do this!

104
00:06:15,199 --> 00:06:15,975
Yeah!

105
00:06:15,975 --> 00:06:18,593
Mega Trucker, Mega Power Tackle!

106
00:06:19,235 --> 00:06:23,420
No one can stop the unstoppable! Mega Trucker! Raah!

107
00:06:23,420 --> 00:06:26,747
I don't even need to try. I can dodge you with my eyes closed.

108
00:06:33,178 --> 00:06:34,930
Next!

109
00:06:34,930 --> 00:06:36,853
Mega Trucker, come back!

110
00:06:37,148 --> 00:06:38,766
That didn't even take ten seconds...

111
00:06:38,766 --> 00:06:40,408
I can't believe it...

112
00:06:40,408 --> 00:06:41,951
Phoenix Fire, you're up!

113
00:06:41,951 --> 00:06:43,279
Ok!

114
00:06:43,279 --> 00:06:44,966
Speed attack! Water Splash!

115
00:06:45,629 --> 00:06:47,185
Water Splash!

116
00:06:49,933 --> 00:06:50,922
Get back here!

117
00:07:00,605 --> 00:07:01,798
Look out behind you!

118
00:07:02,353 --> 00:07:04,343
Wild Slash!

119
00:07:07,442 --> 00:07:09,468
Phoenix Fire, are you alright?

120
00:07:09,468 --> 00:07:10,692
He's too strong...

121
00:07:10,692 --> 00:07:12,553
Jun, you need to get serious!

122
00:07:12,553 --> 00:07:14,278
I know.

123
00:07:14,278 --> 00:07:15,987
Your turn, Mega Ambler!

124
00:07:16,588 --> 00:07:19,213
Don't think that changing the players will change the outcome.

125
00:07:19,213 --> 00:07:21,665
You should really learn some manners, kid.

126
00:07:21,665 --> 00:07:25,237
Crest is right. Stop wasting my time.

127
00:07:25,237 --> 00:07:26,483
Just show me what you've got.

128
00:07:26,483 --> 00:07:28,497
What an attitude on this guy.

129
00:07:28,497 --> 00:07:30,295
His nose is so high in the air!

130
00:07:30,295 --> 00:07:32,824
Jun. We are ready whenever you are.

131
00:07:32,824 --> 00:07:35,576
Alright! It's time for some rapid-strike attacks!

132
00:07:35,576 --> 00:07:38,257
Mega Ambler, Forceps Crush!

133
00:07:38,257 --> 00:07:39,548
Forceps Crush!

134
00:07:52,129 --> 00:07:54,915
Shadow X, Spinning Cutter!

135
00:07:54,915 --> 00:07:56,389
Spinning Cutter!

136
00:07:59,966 --> 00:08:02,682
Haha! Better watch your head, buddy!

137
00:08:08,759 --> 00:08:08,983
Dexter!

138
00:08:09,406 --> 00:08:10,785
Spear Thrust!

139
00:08:10,896 --> 00:08:12,865
Spear Thrust!

140
00:08:19,538 --> 00:08:21,779
Wild... Slash!

141
00:08:26,350 --> 00:08:28,439
Jun! Send me out there!

142
00:08:28,524 --> 00:08:31,346
No matter who you send out, the result will be the same!

143
00:08:31,346 --> 00:08:32,842
Fleta Z, setup-

144
00:08:32,842 --> 00:08:34,270
Hold on, Jun.

145
00:08:34,270 --> 00:08:35,365
Blue Cop?

146
00:08:35,365 --> 00:08:36,779
Send me out this time.

147
00:08:36,779 --> 00:08:38,187
Are you sure?

148
00:08:38,187 --> 00:08:39,129
Yes.

149
00:08:39,129 --> 00:08:41,584
Don't worry, Blue Cop. I can finish him.

150
00:08:41,584 --> 00:08:44,790
That's not the problem. Please. Let me, Fleta Z.

151
00:08:44,790 --> 00:08:47,538
...I understand. Please go ahead.

152
00:08:53,200 --> 00:08:55,302
At last you show up, Blue Cop.

153
00:08:55,302 --> 00:08:59,289
I thought you'd be the finale, but I see you're ready to fight now.

154
00:08:59,289 --> 00:09:03,701
When planet Machina was destroyed, I was alone too.

155
00:09:03,701 --> 00:09:07,450
I spent ages wandering through space alone.

156
00:09:07,450 --> 00:09:10,921
When I finally reached this planet, I found my kind again. And I cannot bring myself to hurt any of them.

157
00:09:10,921 --> 00:09:13,181
What a pathetic excuse...

158
00:09:13,181 --> 00:09:16,394
Just let me defeat you!

159
00:09:17,182 --> 00:09:19,734
I have crawled back up from the brink of death!

160
00:09:19,734 --> 00:09:22,234
Endlessly honing my skills to become stronger!

161
00:09:22,234 --> 00:09:25,659
I am the one who is fit to be Star Guardian!

162
00:09:28,576 --> 00:09:29,662
Haven't you figured it out yet?

163
00:09:29,662 --> 00:09:30,571
What?

164
00:09:31,988 --> 00:09:35,485
Blue Cop said that he doesn't want his friends to get hurt anymore!

165
00:09:35,485 --> 00:09:38,628
When are you going to realize that includes you?!

166
00:09:39,389 --> 00:09:42,110
Stop pretending to be so righteous!

167
00:09:48,322 --> 00:09:51,209
This can't be... my sword!

168
00:09:51,274 --> 00:09:52,169
Blue Cop!

169
00:09:52,169 --> 00:09:53,745
Let's finish this, Jun!

170
00:10:02,380 --> 00:10:04,419
Infinity...

171
00:10:04,419 --> 00:10:05,551
Force...

172
00:10:05,551 --> 00:10:07,135
Break!!

173
00:10:22,575 --> 00:10:24,879
Wild Guardy!

174
00:10:27,149 --> 00:10:28,240
Why...

175
00:10:28,240 --> 00:10:30,701
...why can't I beat him...?

176
00:10:30,701 --> 00:10:33,981
Does this mean I'm not cut out to be a Star Guardian?

177
00:10:33,981 --> 00:10:35,765
That's not true, Wild Guardy.

178
00:10:36,451 --> 00:10:39,100
I don't need your empty words...!

179
00:10:39,100 --> 00:10:40,457
I mean it.

180
00:10:40,457 --> 00:10:45,710
Deus Machina told me, right before planet Machina collapsed,

181
00:10:45,710 --> 00:10:49,245
that I must use the Metal Breath, to find a friend.

182
00:10:49,245 --> 00:10:50,759
A friend...?

183
00:10:55,350 --> 00:10:57,105
Are you sure it's okay, Crest?

184
00:10:59,477 --> 00:11:01,130
I made a promise.

185
00:11:09,105 --> 00:11:10,678
Metal Cardbot, Change Up!

186
00:11:15,549 --> 00:11:17,171
Wild Guardy, sealed!

